<title>USA: Textron Inc sets quarterly div at $0.50.</title>
<headline>Textron Inc sets quarterly div at $0.50.</headline>
<dateline>PROVIDENCE, R.I. 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.50		     $0.50</p>
<p> Pay		    July 1</p>
<p> Record		June 13</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company said it has previously announced a two-for-one common stock split in the form of a stock dividend, payable May 30. The lastest dividend is a pre-split dividend, and accordingly it will be adjusted to $0.25 per share.</p>
</text>
